### Playground requests: open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension, click "Send Request".
### Start the server first:  npm start
@host = http://localhost:3000

### Index of ALL endpoints
GET {{host}}/?format=json

### ===== 02 Concurrency =====
### Run /blocking, then IMMEDIATELY run /ping in another tab: ping hangs until blocking finishes
GET {{host}}/concurrency/blocking?ms=3000
###
GET {{host}}/concurrency/ping
###
GET {{host}}/concurrency/non-blocking?ms=3000
###
GET {{host}}/concurrency/cpu-main?n=42
###
GET {{host}}/concurrency/cpu-worker?n=42
###
GET {{host}}/concurrency/child-process
###
GET {{host}}/concurrency/threadpool?jobs=8
###
GET {{host}}/concurrency/event-loop-lag

