### ===== 05 Files & streams =====
### Upload a file (pick any file path): streams to disk
POST {{host}}/files/upload
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./package.json
###
GET {{host}}/files
###
GET {{host}}/files/generate?mb=100
###
GET {{host}}/files/memory-demo?mode=buffer&mb=100
###
GET {{host}}/files/memory-demo?mode=stream&mb=100

